                        "email": "vince_chang@aspeedtech.com",
                        "username": "VinceChang6637"
                    },
                    "message": "Thanks for the feedback. We plan to upstream AST2700 support, but it may take some time. We need this branch, or for OpenBMC\u2019s U-Boot to support the 2023.10 release, to enable AST2700 bring-up and testing."
                }
